  "notes": "{読|よ}み{返|かえ}す is a compound verb combining {読|よ}む (to read) + {返|かえ}す (to return/repeat), meaning to read again.\n\nVERB TYPE: Godan verb (u-verb), transitive\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {本|ほん}を{読|よ}み{返|かえ}す (to reread a book)\n- {手紙|てがみ}を{読|よ}み{返|かえ}す (to reread a letter)\n- {何度|なんど}も{読|よ}み{返|かえ}す (to reread many times)\n\nRELATED 〜{返|かえ}す COMPOUND VERBS:\n- {書|か}き{返|かえ}す (to write back)\n- {聞|き}き{返|かえ}す (to ask again)\n- {見|み}{返|かえ}す (to look back at)\n- {繰|く}り{返|かえ}す (to repeat)",
